            "review_text": "Chinh Nguyen\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam73 contributions\n0\nFantastic food and great vibe in District 7\nMar 2026 • Family\nMùi Kitchen, located at 53 Tan Hung, is an absolute delight. The menu is clearly well thought out, offering a unique and authentic taste that stands out from the usual spots. The atmosphere is cozy, clean, and beautifully decorated, making it a perfect spot for both relaxed dinners and get-togethers. The staff is attentive and provides excellent service. Highly recommend this hidden gem if you are exploring District 7!\nRead more\nWritten April 12, 2026",
